= Justifying our actions

Our recent actions has been questioned by the Ethics Committee whether our actions were following the frameworks in the code of ethics.

- @detailed: Provide detailed accounts of our actions.
- @root: Let's do this later.
- @easy_discard

@detailed
subtitle: -3 resources
choose-if: resources >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; ethics_committee_relation += 20

We have provided detailed accounts that our actions were justified and within the framework of the code of ethics. The ethics committee is satisfied.
